eceive my order?","content":"<p>Order processing takes 1–2 business days after submission. Once processed, shipping usually takes 3–7 business days, depending on your location.<br\/>(Except for special circumstances such as warehouse overflow during peak season or force majeure, e.g., floods, which may cause delivery delays.)<\/p>"}},"item_WpeJaT":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"4. About Flash Sales","content":"<p>During Black Friday, we’ll be running 24-hour flash sales that will end either when the time runs out or when stocks sell out.<br\/><br\/><em>Note: Flash sale products are not covered by the 30-day price guarantee.<\/em><\/p>"}},"item_P7EMdV":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"5. 30-Day Price Match Guarantee","content":"<p>Orders placed on uk.merachfit.com during the Promotion Period starting from November 1 are eligible for the 30-day Price Match Guarantee.<br\/><br\/>If a lower price is found on uk.merachfit.com within 30 days of the order date (excluding flash sales), participants may contact info.uk@merachfit.com to request a price adjustment.<br\/><br\/>This Price Guarantee is valid only for purchases made directly on uk.merachfit.com. The lower price must apply to the identical product listed on uk.merachfit.com.<br\/><br\/>The Price Match Guarantee does not apply to purchases from marketplace resellers, financing offers, coupons, gift card offers, bundles, free items, customizable configurations, specialty products, pricing errors, service and installation offers, limited-quantity items, out-of-stock products, deal-of-the-day, flash sales, closeouts, discontinued items, clearance products, final sale items, or any paid membership club offers.<br\/><br\/>Note: Flash sale products are not covered by the 30-day price guarantee.<\/p>"}},"item_P4drWG":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"6. How can I contact Merach with questions about a promotion?","content":"<p>If you have any questions about ongoing promotions or your order, please contact our support team:<\/p><p>📧 Email: info.uk@merachfit.com<br\/>💬 Live Chat: Available at the bottom right corner of our website<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["item_7epCYj","item_LBDrkg","item_PgzzbU","item_qkJBJT","item_WpeJaT","item_P7EMdV","item_P4drWG"],"name":"FAQ","settings":{"full_width":true,"subheading":"","title":"FAQ","content":"","team_avatar_width":160,"support_hours":"","answer_time":"","button_text":"","button_url":"","text_position":"center","background":"#1a1a1a","background_gradient":"","text_color":"#f8f8f8","heading_color":"","heading_gradient":"","button_background":"","button_text_color":"","accordion_background":"","accordion_text_color":""}},"text_with_icons_YADEGi":{"type":"text-with-icons","blocks":{"item_dQGXpE":{"type":"item","settings":{"icon":"picto-coupon","custom_icon":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/merachfit_uk_smart_home_fitness_trust_us_logo_3.png","mobile_icon_width":60,"icon_width":100,"icon_background_type":"circle","icon_background":"#ffffff","icon_color":"","title":"FREE SHIPPING","content":"<p>3-7 days fast delivery<\/p>"}},"item_3CGfAJ":{"type":"item","settings":{"icon":"picto-coupon","custom_icon":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/merachfit_uk_smart_home_fitness_trust_us_logo_4.png","mobile_icon_width":60,"icon_width":100,"icon_background_type":"circle","icon_background":"#ffffff","icon_color":"","title":"780 K+ USERS","content":"<p>Top Brand<\/p>"}},"item_PE36dx":{"type":"item","settings":{"icon":"picto-coupon","custom_icon":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/merachfit_uk_smart_home_fitness_trust_us_logo_5.png","mobile_icon_width":60,"icon_width":100,"icon_background_type":"circle","icon_background":"#ffffff","icon_color":"","title":"30 DAY RETURN","content":"<p>Worry-free Shopping<\/p>"}},"item_4g9N7n":{"type":"item","settings":{"icon":"picto-coupon","custom_icon":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/merachfit_uk_smart_home_fitness_trust_us_logo_2.png","mobile_icon_width":60,"icon_width":100,"icon_background_type":"circle","icon_background":"#ffffff","icon_color":"","ti